{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Docker Container.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Docker Container.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"docker container docker container","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Docker Container.md","fileName":"Docker Container.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Docker Container","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-08 22:09\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Containerized Microservice Architecture]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Containerized Microservice Architecture","c8andnetcore30projectsusingazure.pdf","hands-onrestfulwebserviceswithaspnetcore3.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Docker Container.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Docker Container.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"docker container docker container","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Docker Container.md","fileName":"Docker Container.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Docker Container","heading":"Docker Container","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"A Docker container is an isolated running instance created from an image that packages an application and its dependencies. It avoids relying on a target machine to reproduce the exact library and framework environment used during development and testing.\n\nThe book runs its .NET Core 3 worker in a Linux container. The container is lighter than copying an entire virtual machine because it packages the application environment while remaining abstracted from much of the host operating system.\n\nFor microservice deployment, the container supplies an isolated, repeatable runtime unit across compatible hosts. The book connects that packaging boundary to independent service deployment while keeping durable state and service contracts outside the disposable container instance.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Containerized Microservice Architecture","c8andnetcore30projectsusingazure.pdf","hands-onrestfulwebserviceswithaspnetcore3.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Docker Container.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Docker Container.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"docker container docker container","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Docker Container.md","fileName":"Docker Container.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Docker Container","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[hands-onsoftwarearchitecturewithc8andnetcore3.pdf]]\n\n[[c8andnetcore30projectsusingazure.pdf]]\n[[hands-onrestfulwebserviceswithaspnetcore3.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Containerized Microservice Architecture","c8andnetcore30projectsusingazure.pdf","hands-onrestfulwebserviceswithaspnetcore3.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}